### Health
GET http://localhost:8000/health HTTP/1.1


### Start a new conversation (no x-session-id → server creates one and returns it in response header)
POST http://localhost:8000/v1/conversation/chat HTTP/1.1
X-User-ID: 2279450
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_input": "What time is it in London?",
  "translate": false
}


### Continue an existing conversation (echo back the x-session-id from the previous response)
POST http://localhost:8000/v1/conversation/chat HTTP/1.1
X-User-ID: 2279450
x-session-id: REPLACE_WITH_SESSION_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_input": "And in Sydney?",
  "translate": false
}